ACCEPTABLE ASSEMBLY TYPES:
 - compas.geometry.Box
 - compas.geometry.Cylinder
 - compas_timber.assembly.TimberAssemblies (REQUIRE .obj EXPORT)
 - compas.datastructures.Mesh : (WIP)(Will REQUIRE .obj EXPORT)

NOTE: For assembly types of TimberAssembly &amp; Mesh Assembly .obj handling should also happen in this step. Example below.</item>
