                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4: Set QRFrames Positions is required for establishing the location of the object in virtual space based on the reference images.

- This is used specifically for each individual tracking image within the application.
- NOTE: List order represents the oreder of QRImages
- NOTE: These positions need to be measured EXTREMELY accuratly for proper visualization of objects in space.</item>
                  </items>
