                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2e16b62f-3b40-4b5e-a00c-15f432cc9602</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 5: Upload Entire Project to Firebase RTDB. This component is used to upload all project data to the Firebase RealTime Database under a specified project name.

INPUTS:

 - config_filepath: String
   - Path from the configuration comopnent used to connec to specific firebase.

 - assembly : compas.datastructures.Assembly or compas_timber.assembly.TimberAssembly
   - The assembly in which data will be extracted from.
        
 - building_plan : compas_timber.planning.BuildingPlan
   - The BuildingPlan in which data will be extracted from.
        
 - qr_frames_list : list of compas.geometry.Frame
   - List of frames at specific locations for application localization data.


- NOTE: It is key to name the project well, as it is used to define the information that the application is reading from.
- NOTE: project name cannot include any extension of "." this will signify a file type (ex: .json) and result in an error on upload.</item>
                  </items>
