                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 7: Visualizatoin of Current Project State can be used to visualize all information in the Current State of the Project on the Firebase Realtime Database.

INPUTS:

 - config_filepath: String
   - Path from the configuration comopnent used to connec to specific firebase.

 - assembly: compas.datastructures.Assembly or compas_timber.assembly.TimberAssembly
   - The assembly uploaded to the project.

 - project_name: String
   - The project name on the Realtime Database you would like to visualize

 - visualize: bool
   - A button that will update the component and trigger visualization.


</item>
                  </items>
